:: \ Scene 2.1 {"position":"875,1700","size":"100,100"}
INT. TPA HQ MEETING ROOM - JUNE 12, 4373 - MORNING

//You are currently in the meeting room with Alyssa and William while a TPA Officer is breifing you on today's meeting.//

[TPA OFFICER 
Agents, TPA Inteligence detected Rogue activity in the TPA Archive on June 13th, 4360.]

[JACK
Wait, June 13th, 4360? That's the day the city was attacked.]

[TPA OFFICER
Correct. The documents within the archive could compromise the agency if they fall into the wrong hands. Your mission is to ensure no Rogue escapes with any information at all cost. Do you understand?]

[JACK
But why aren't we stopping the attack from happening?]

[TPA OFFICER
I said, do you understand?]

[JACK
[[Yes]]
[[No]]
[[This doesn't make sense.]]
[[... -> Scene 2.1 Choice 1]]]


:: \ Scene 2.1 Choice 1 {"position":"1100,1825","size":"100,100"}
//Jack remains silent.//

[TPA OFFICER
Hello? Are you listening? I asked do you understand?]

[JACK
Yes sir.]

[TPA OFFICER
Then I wish you good luck, the fate of the world depends on it.]

//Alyssa pressed a button on the device around her wrist and it opens up a portal. All three step inside.//

[[Next -> Scene 2.2 Pt 1]]


:: \ Scene 2.2 Pt 1 {"position":"875,1950","size":"100,100"}
INT. TPA HQ - JUNE 13, 4360 - MORNING

//Jack, Alyssa, and William exit the portal. You are standing in the meeting room just years earlier.//

[WILLIAM
Ugh I shouldn't have eaten much for breakfast.]

[ALYSSA
I told you pancakes might've not been the best idea.]

//Jack is taking in his surroundings, the meeting room looks newer and the calendar says June 13, 4360. The time is 6:00 am.// 

[JACK
Wow this is crazy. I can't believe it.]

[ALYSSA
Come on we have to get to the archives.]

//Jack, Alyssa, and William rush to the archive's room. On the way there they notice the building is practically empty with only a few employees here or there.//

[WILLIAM
Do you guys think it's odd no one is in here.]

[ALYSSA
Yeah it is a bit strange but lets focus on the mission at hand.]

//Jack, Alyssa, and William enter the archives room. It is circular and in the middle there is a cylinder core that contains energy. Around it is rows of books, boxes, and artifacts. There are 15 rows where 1 is the outermost row and 15 is the inner most.//

[ALYSSA
We should split up and take watch. I'll take rows 1 through 5, William you take 6 through 10, and Jack you take 11 through 15. If we see anything stop them at all cost.]

[WILLIAM
Shouldn't we see what they do first?]

[ALYSSA
You heard him this mission is extremly important. We can't fail. Now lets move.]

//Jack, Alyssa, and William split up and take watch over their selected area. Jack walks along the rows as time passes. No one said anything over comms and the explosion happened around noon. It is currently 11:46 am. Jack suddenly hears a rustle. Jack presses a button on the device around his wrist and speaks into it.//

[JACK
(Over comms)
Guys I think I hear something a few rows over.]

[ALYSSA
(Over comms)
Ok stay alert guys. Remember we can't let them escape with anything. Jack you're the closest to them what should we do?]

[JACK
(Over comms)
I think we should try and talk to them. Get more information out of them.]

[ALYSSA
(Over comms)
Are you sure?]

[JACK
(Over comms)
Yeah lets surround them first though incase they try to run.]

//Jack walks closer to where he heard the noise//

[WILLIAM
(Over comms)
We are in position]

//Jack sees Alyssa and William in the distance. He signals them to move towards the source of the noise. They see a figure rustling through a box of folders.//

[JACK
Hi there, I'm Jack and this is William and Alyssa. We mean you no harm. All we ask is you leave everything where it is and come with us to answer a few questions.]

//The figure stands up with a folder in his hand and turns to Jack. It is revealed he is a man who looked slightly older than Jack. He slowly walks towards Jack.//

[MAN
You think I would follow you after what you guys have done. Never.]

//The man attacks Jack and rushes towards the exit.//

[JACK
Guys, he’s heading for the exit!]

//Jack notices a shockwave gun in a nearby box. He grabs it and aims above the doorway.//

[JACK
Look out!]

//Alyssa and William duck as the weapon fires a shockwave. Debris crashes down, blocking the exit. The man falls from the blast. The folder flies open, scattering files across the room. The man scrambles to retrieve them, but Alyssa and William grab him.//

[JACK
Hold him still! Sir, you’re coming with us. Any attempt to escape will only make things worse for you.]

//The Rogue smirks, slightly amused.//

[MAN
You think you know everything, don’t you?]

[JACK
What are you talking about?]

[MAN
Do you hear that?]

//Sounds of explosions echo faintly through the building.//

[JACK
Hear what?]

[MAN
The explosions, someone set them up. Someone wants you to think it’s us.]

//Jack hesitates, confused.//

[JACK
I don’t understand.]

[MAN
Trust me, it will all come to light eventually.]

//The man lunges for Jack’s weapon and grabs it. He fires at William and Alyssa, sending them off him. He rushes past Jack, picking up files along the way. Jack pursues, but the man reaches the core and shoots it. A crack spreads across the glass above the core, growing until it shatters. Sparks ignite papers and artifacts. Flames quickly engulf the archives. Alyssa and William are out of sight while the man opens a portal to the present.

[JACK
[[Find my friends]]
[[Chase after the man]]]


:: \ Scene 2.2 Pt 4 {"position":"875,2225","size":"100,100"}
[JACK
Alright, let’s get out of here.]

//Alyssa opens the portal back to the present. Jack notices a file burning away on the floor titled June 13, 4360 Plans//

[WILLIAM
Are you coming?]

//Jack steps through the portal with William and Alyssa. Flames consume the archives as they disappears into the present, all of the documents inside are lost.//

[[Next -> Scene 3.1]]


:: \ Scene 3.1 {"position":"875,2350","size":"100,100"}
INT. TPA HQ MEETING ROOM - JUNE 12, 4373 - AFTERNOON

//Jack, Alyssa, and William stumble out of the portal and are now back in the present. The TPA Officer was waiting from them. //

[TPA OFFICER
Good job on the mission. Though next time I'd reccomend just shooting him instead of igniting the whole place on fire.]

[JACK
Wait how do you know?]

[TPA OFFICER
It happened years ago and now we have a new archives room. this time it has a sprinkler system. Also, he didn't get away with any files correct?]

[ALYSSA
Jack you saw him escape did you see if he took anything?]

[JACK
(inner thoughts)
He did, but the title I saw makes me hesitate. It doesn't seem like they realized files were taken so perhaps I should just say no.]

[JACK
Not from I can tell. Besides the ones he tried to take burned down with all the other stuff.]

[TPA OFFICER
Ok glad to hear that, otherwise we'd have a major problem on our hands. Anyways since you ended early you have the rest of the day to yourself. I'll see you first thing in the morning. Also, remember only those that have one of these devices remembers what the past was before altering the timeline. You are dismissed.]

[[Next -> Scene 3.2]]




:: \ Scene 3.2 {"position":"875,2475","size":"100,100"}
EXT. CITY - JUNE 12 4373 - AFTERNOON

//Jack, Alyssa, and William are walking outside in the city. Jack is currently dazed out thinking about everything that happened.//

[WILLIAM
Well that went well.]

[ALYSSA
Yeah good job team.]

[WILLIAM
Hey you guys want to get something to eat to celebrate?]

[ALYSSA
Sure that sounds great. Where should we go?]

//Alyssa picks up on Jack's mood.//

[ALYSSA
Hey Jack, you good?]

[JACK
Oh, yeah. Sorry I was just thinking about everything.]

(if: $chasedAfterMan is false)
[
[WILLIAM
Hey buddy don't stress. Were safe and alive that's all that matters.]

[ALYSSA
We also made sure he didn't leave with anything.]
]
(else-if: $chasedAfterMan is true)
[
[WILLIAM
Hey if you had any regrets it should've been leaving us to almost die. But it's no big deal, we're fine. Right Alyssa.]

[ALYSSA
Yeah just a bit bruised but nothing to bad. Also we were able to stop him from taking anything which is good.]
]
]

[JACK
Yeah about that...]

//A hooded figure enters a dark alleyway.//

[ALYSSA
Wait did you see that?]

[WILLIAM
What?]

[ALYSSA
That guy, he has a similar build to the man we saw in the archives. He just went down that alleyway.]

[WILLIAM
That direction is downtown. Do you think he's up to something?]

[ALYSSA
Perhaps. We still don't know where the man in the archives went.]

[JACK
(inner thoughts)
If that is the guy I need to ask him about what he meant and the file title I saw.]

[JACK
We should follow him.]

(if: $alyssaFriendship is 0 and ($williamFriendship is 1 or $williamFriendship is 2))
[
[ALYSSA
Jack are you sure, we still don't know who that guy is or if he has any weapons. We should just report it instead let higher ups handle it.]

[JACK
If we wait till reinforcements come in he might be long gone.]

[WILLIAM
I agree with Jack if we end up waiting we might lose him.

[ALYSSA
Alright lets go.]
]
(else-if: $williamFriendship is 0 and ($alyssaFriendship is 1 or $alyssaFriendship is 2))
[
[WILLIAM
Jack you sure? It could've just been someone trying to get home.]

[JACK
I'm positive, it seemed like he didn't want any attention to himself.]

[ALYSSA
I agree, from what I saw he did sneak into the alleyway.]
]

[WILLIAM
Alright lets go.]
]

//Jack, Alyssa, and William follow the hooded guy. He walks for around an hour. He ends up going downtown where the city isn't as nice or upkept as the upper east side. He is seen entering what looks like an abandoned office building.//

[JACK
Come on lets go.]

//Jack, Alyssa, and William enter.//

[[Next -> Scene 3.3 Pt1]]











:: \ Scene 3.3 Choice 2 {"position":"1100,2725","size":"100,100"}
//Jack stays silent. He's trying to understand all the information that is being said.//

[[Next -> Scene 3.3 Pt 3]]


:: \ Scene 3.3 Pt 3 {"position":"875,2850","size":"100,100"}
[ELEANOR
We figured out the TPA had plans to blow up buildings in the city to pin it on us. They wanted to give the citizens an enemy so they could have more control over them. They thought they could scare them into compliance.]

[JACK
So that's what the files are about then. It was the plans for the attack.]

[ELEANOR
Correct, the files Levi was able to recover is a map of all the bomb locations, schematics of the bombs, and the official signature of approval from Frank Bowen.]

//Alyssa is in shock.//

[ALYSSA
That's my dad!]

[ELEANOR
I'm so sorry child.]

//Alysaa tries to get out of Igor's grasp. Igor remains firm.//

[ALYSSA
No you must have it mistaken. My dad loves me! He loves this city! He would never hurt innocents!]

//Levi shows her the file with the signature on it.//

[ALYSSA
No it must be forged! Jack you said he didn't leave with anything!]

[JACK
I'm sorry, I didn't want to mention it in the debriefing because you guys were so happy. But I promise I was going to tell you at lunch.]

//Alyssa starts crying.//

[ALYSSA
No this can't be. You are liars! He'd never do this, not to me.]

[WILLIAM
I'd like to know more before putting labels on things.]

[ALYSSA
(Feeder Line)
There's no way you believe this!)

[JACK
[[Comfort Alyssa]]
[[Ask for more explanation.]]
]


:: \ Scene 3.3 Pt 4 {"position":"875,3100","size":"100,100"}
[ELEANOR
I know this must be hard but we are trying to make amends. The attack was hard on all of us. Trust me I was there. When we heard of the plans we had agents all over the city disguised in TPA uniforms to try and minimize the damage. I remember this boy, he was next to a building when I heard an explosion. He looked up and froze in fear. I knew I had to do something even if it meant I would die. I luckily was able to save him before it was too late. I would never forget the look of admiration he gave me. It made me realize what were doing had to be continued, no matter the costs.]

//Jack is shocked.//

[JACK
I was that boy. You saved me.]

[ELEANOR
Well then it's good to see you again.]

[[Next -> Scene 4.1 Pt 1]]


:: \ Scene 3.3 Pt1 {"position":"875,2600","size":"100,100"}
INT. ABANDONED OFFICE BUILDING - JUNE 12 4373 - AFTERNOON

//Jack, Alyssa, and William enter the building, they see a staircase that goes to the basement and all the way to the top of the building.  The only light shining through is from the sun. The hooded guy is no where to be seen.//

[WILLIAM
That doesn't look up to code.]

[JACK
Alright lets split up. I'll take the basement, William you take this floor, and Alyssa take the second. If we don't find anything we'll meet back on this floor.]

//The group splits off and Jack ends up going down the stairs into the basement. As he's walking the long halls he hears faint talking coming from up ahead. As he gets closer to the source of the noise he sees an enterance and what looks like a run down conference room. He hides behind a near by box. From there he can hear and see two woman and a male. The hooded man takes off the hood.//

[JACK
(inner thoughts)
Alyssa was right, that guy was from the archives.]

[WOMAN
Did you retrieve the files Levi?]

[JACK
(inner thoughts)
So that's what his name is.]

[LEVI
Sort of ma'am. I was intercepted by TPA Agents and was only able to recover a few. The rest ended up burning with the rest of the archives.]

[WOMAN
Hmm interesting. Violet you're positive no TPA Agents were in the archives when you did survelence runs.]

//The man next to the woman talks.//

[VIOLET
Yes ma'am. Everyone was out of the building that day everytime I checked.]

[WOMAN
That means the TPA can now detect time traveling outside their organization. We must remain vigilent, especially since we have information that can take them down.]

[VIOLET
Mind me interupting ma'am but it appears we have a guest with us today.]

//Someone grabs you and you two walk into the room. There you see a second entrance that's unable to be seen from your spot behind the box. There is also around 20 other people both men and women ranging from young to old scattered across the room.//

[LEVI
You! What are you doing here.]

[WOMAN
Thank you Igor for escorting our guest. You may put him down.]

//Igor, a tall muscular man. puts down Jack. Jack stands and aims the device around his wrist at the woman.//

[JACK
You are under arrest for conspiring against the TPA. Anything you do or say may be used against you.]

[WOMAN
Levi this guy is funny, where did you find him?]

[LEVI
He was one of the agents at the archives which means his other two friends must be here as well.]

//Igor and another walk back out of the room.//

[WOMAN
Hmm very well. What is your name child?]

//Jack is still aiming the device at the woman and doesn't answer the question.//

[WOMAN
Well if your not going to cooperate I might as well tell you those devices are useless here and from the looks of it you are outnumbered.]

//Jack lowers his arm.//

[JACK
How is that possible?]

[WOMAN
Jasmine here is our lead engineer and former TPA agent. Once she learned the truth she decided to use her knowledge for good. Since then she was able to remake the devices you wear for us, along with disabiling any high tech gadgets in this entire building. Including those devices you wear around your wrist.]

//Igor and the other guy return with William and Alyssa in hand.//

[WOMAN
Ah more guests. Welcome.]

[ALYSSA
Let us go!]

//The woman nods to Igor and the other guy, they let go of Alyssa and William.//

[WILLIAM
Jack what's happening?]

[JACK
These are the Rogues, Alyssa was right the man we followed was the man from the archives.] 

[ALYSSA
Why didn't you call for help?]

[JACK
Our devices don't work in here, something is disabiling it.]

[WILLIAM
Please let us go I don't want to die.]

[WOMAN
Die? What do you think we'll do to you?]

[WILLIAM
Aren't you going to kill us? We are TPA Agents after all and you are Rogues.]

[WOMAN
We like to call ourselves Truthseekers. Allow me to make a proper introduction, my name is Eleanor the leader of Truthseekers. Here our goal is to enlighten the citizens with the truth about the TPA.]

[ALYSSA
What truth could you possibly be talking about? You're Rogues, you lie and you kill all for your own selfish need.]

[ELEANOR
Is that what's said about us at TPA. Geez I knew they thought we were killers but liars. Very hypocritical.]

//Alyssa lunged towards Eleanor but is held back by Igor.//

[WILLIAM
What do you mean?]

[LEVI
What she means is you should fact check your sources.]

[ELEANOR
Levi calm down.]

[LEVI
No I will not! I almost died getting those files! Tell them the truth so they know what's at stake!]

[ELEANOR
Very well. The TPA as you know it is the Time Preservation Agency, but to those who know the truth they are the Time Purification Agency. The TPA has been lying to you for years. They go back in time and change events that they can spin in the present for their own gain. We the Truthseekers or as you call us Rogues go back in time to try and stop them. Our earlier methods were focused on stopping the disaster. But we eventually realized they would just go back again and cause the same destruction. That's how it landed us here. Once the attack on June 13th we knew we needed to shine light on the truth. So we decided to lay low and plan. We improved technology, gathered more supporters, and upgraded our base.]

[JACK
[[Didn't you do that?]]
[[I'm confused.]]
[[How can I trust you?]]
[[... -> Scene 3.3 Choice 2]]
]


:: \ Scene 4.1 Choice 1 {"position":"1100,3350","size":"100,100"}
//Jack remains silent.//

[ALYSSA
That's probably one of the stupid conspiracies you've heard.]

[WILLIAM
Is not.]

[[Next -> Scene 4.1 Pt 2]]


:: \ Scene 4.1 Choice 2 {"position":"1100,3600","size":"100,100"}
//Jack remains silent.//

[ALYSSA
How dare you say that! He is a good father who loves his community.]

[WILLIAM
I don't think a good father would kill a bunch of people but who knows.]

[ELEANOR
Alyssa, I'm sorry this is how you had to find out. I knew he had a daughter but I didn't know she was you. We had a whole plan on how we wanted to tell you. I know this isn't easy but let us help you.]

[[Next -> Scene 4.1 Pt 3]]


:: \ Scene 4.1 Pt 1 {"position":"875,3225","size":"100,100"}
INT. ABANDONED OFFICE BUILDING - JUNE 12 4373 - AFTERNOON - CONT

[WILLIAM
Holy cow. So the conspiracies were true. You are the good guys. Jack isn't it crazy that the person who inspired you to be a TPA Agent was actually a Rogue, uh I mean Truthseeker.]

[ALYSSA
No way you actually believe this. I know you didn't read any of the books but did training teach you nothing. They're liars.]

[WILLIAM
Alyssa we just saw the files with your dad's signature on it.]

[ALYSSA
They're forged and he wouldn't do that. Also perhaps they planted the files in the archives to actually pin it on the TPA.]

[WILLIAM
That is just ridiculous, why would they go back in time for that when all they could've done is just make the files and publish them. They're telling the truth.]

[ALYSSA
(Feeder Line)
Are you believing this too Jack?]

[JACK
[[The TPA wouldn't lie.]]
[[Maybe this is the truth.]]
[[Both could have truth and lies.]]
[[... -> Scene 4.1 Choice 1]]
]


:: \ Scene 4.1 Pt 2 {"position":"875,3475","size":"100,100"}
[ELEANOR
The truth can be scary when it threatens to break down the comfort of what you believe.]

[ALYSSA
Don't listen to her. She's clearly crazy, no leader of the Rogues would actually be sane.]

[WILLIAM
And why not? Clearly your dad isn't sane if he planned the attack.]

[JACK
[[Why pin it on you?]]
[[Show us more proof.]]
[[Both sides could be manipulating.]]
[[... -> Scene 4.1 Choice 2]]
]


:: \ Scene 4.1 Pt 3 {"position":"875,3725","size":"100,100"}
[ALYSSA
Well I'm leaving. I'm going straight to my father and  telling him everything.]

[WILLIAM
Well then you'll be going without me.]

[ALYSSA
What? Are you serious? You'd rather stick around with people, actually Rogues, that you just met rather than your friend.]

[WILLIAM
If my friend is willing to excuse the killing of innocents, even when there is proof. then you are not my friend.]

[ALYSSA
Ugh I didn't need you anyways. Come on Jack.]

[JACK
(feeder line) (inner thoughts)
I know no matter what I do I have the possibility to lose a friend.]

[JACK
[[Go with Alyssa]]
[[Stay with William]]
]

(set: $choseAlyssa to false)


:: \ Scene 5.1 Alyssa {"position":"800,3975","size":"100,100"}
EXT. CITY - JUNE 12 4373 - AFTERNOON - CONT

[ALYSSA
Finally we are out of that building. I will call my father immediately and tell him everything. Jack are you ok?]

[JACK
I'm not sure. On one hand I feel like I'm doing the right thing. Though on the other hand I just lost one of my closest friends.] 

[ALYSSA
You are doing the right thing and if William was our friend he'd be here with us.]

[JACK
I guess. I just want to help people.]

[ALYSSA
I know, and you are we just need to call my father before we make any plans.]

[JACK
Alright.]

//Alyssa calls her father over the device.//

[FRANK BOWEN
(over speaker)
Hello Frank Bowen speaking.]

[ALYSSA
Hi Father it's Alyssa.]

[FRANK BOWEN
(over speaker)
Oh hi sweetie, how was your day? I heard that you did well on your mission today.]

[ALYSSA
Yeah about that a Rogue did manage to steal some files.]

[FRANK BOWEN
I'm sorry did I hear that correctly? You managed to let a Rogue escape with the files we specifically told you they couldn't have. And not only that but you lied to us that you successfully completed your mission.]

[ALYSSA
Well not exactly.]

[FRANK BOWEN
(over speaker)
No excuses Alyssa. You know if you want to succeed in this role, especially a team leader, you must not make mistakes.]

[JACK
If you don't mind me interupting sir, this was not Alyssa's fault. I let him get away and didn't tell them he left with files. They only found out afterwards.]

[FRANK BOWEN
(over speaker)
I see. I appreciate you coming clean but as a team leader they must take accountability for their teams failures. Alyssa if you found out earlier, why am I only receiving the call now?]

[ALYSSA
We were in the Rogues base and they were able to block our devices from doing anything.] 

[FRANK BOWEN
(over speaker)
Of course they were. Alyssa take your team and meet me in my office immedately.]

[ALYSSA
About that we are currently one team member down.]

[FRANK BOWEN
(over speaker)
What do you mean?]

[ALYSSA
William stayed behind.]

[FRANK BOWEN
(over speaker)
Even he got fooled by the Rogues lies.]

[ALYSSA
Speaking of lies. They were saying some crazy stuff about you. Like you were the one to sign off on the June 13th attack. I told them that was impossible, you wouldn't do that.]

[FRANK BOWEN
(over speaker)
Well I did.]

[ALYSSA
What? But why!]

[FRANK BOWEN
(over speaker)
If you trust the TPA, if you trust me you'd know it's for the greater good. Now as a department head I order you and Jack to meet me in my office. There's no doubt about it they plan on attacking tomorrow.]

[ALYSSA
Yes sir.]

[[Next -> Scene 5.2 Pt 1 Alyssa]]


:: \ Scene 5.1 William {"position":"950,3975","size":"100,100"}
INT. ABANDONED OFFICE BUILDING - JUNE 12 4373 - AFTERNOON - CONT

[WILLIAM
Should we go after her?]

[ELEANOR
No, we should leave her be.]

[WILLIAM
But she was going to tell her father everything. They will know you have evidence against them.]

[ELEANOR
They already know. Once she stepped out of the building she most likely called her father to tell him there's an emergency.]

[WILLIAM
Well then shouldn't we stop her before she explains everything.]

[ELEANOR
It will only bring more attention to ourselves. Right now we need to get you guys up to speed with our plans.] 

[WILLIAM
Very well. Jack are you ok?]

[JACK
I'm not sure. On one hand I feel like I'm doing the right thing. Though on the other hand I just lost one of my closest friends.]

[ELEANOR
I understand the struggle you are feeling but at this moment it is vital to focus especially since were making our move tomorrow.]

[JACK
Tomorrow is June 13th.]

[ELEANOR
Correct. The TPA always does a speech to honor the lives lost and to push the idea that Rogues are dangerous. Most of the city is in attendance. We figured we strike then.]

[WILLIAM
But how there will be so many TPA agents there.]

[ELEANOR
Jasmine will take control of the broadcast and connect it to our cameras. She will also upload the files and send it out to everyone.]

[JASMINE
There's only two problems with that. The first is we need to get inside the communication wing in order to connect the cameras and upload the files. The second is once we're on the broadcast the TPA will know what were doing and we will only have a short window of time before TPA agents arrive.]

[JACK
I'm assuming this is where we come into play.]

[JASMINE
Correct. Once the TPA removes you from the system you have twenty four hours until your device completely shuts off. Personally I would have the device shut off when removed but they tend to do that so agents can grab their stuff or say goodbye when leaving.]

[JACK
Interesting, but won't they know I was the one that opened the door.]

[JASMINE
For the amount of advance tech they have you'd think they'd have a system for that. But no they won't know. They will only know we're there if they see us or once were connected to the broadcast.]

[ELEANOR
I understand were asking for a lot in such a small period of time but we can build a better world.]

[JACK
All I wanted to do was help people. If this is the way to do it then I'm in.]

[WILLIAM
Same.]

[ELEANOR
Well then, welcome to the Truthseekers.]

[[Next -> Scene 5.2 Pt 1 William]]


:: \ Scene 5.2 Choice 1 {"position":"1100,4350","size":"100,100"}
//Jack stays silent.//

[[Next -> Scene 5.2 Pt 3]]


:: \ Scene 5.2 Choice 2 {"position":"1100,4600","size":"100,100"}
//Jack stays silent.//

[JACK
(inner thoughts)
Why does this have to be so hard.]

[[Next -> Scene 5.2 Pt 4]]


:: \ Scene 5.2 Pt 1 Alyssa {"position":"800,4100","size":"100,100"}
EXT. CITY - JUNE 13 4373 - NOON

